---
// Who OpenAct is built for. The lists say what is true today. Keep the example apps generic.
---
<section class="section" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-title">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Who it's for</p>
    <h2 id="who-title">Built for solo founders and companies.</h2>
    <p>OpenAct is for people who want to build custom agentic apps to power their business. Start with the free core and Projects. Then add the apps that fit how you work.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bento">
    <article class="card aud s6">
      <p class="eyebrow">Solo founders</p>
      <h3>Build the apps your business needs.</h3>
      <p>You run the business alone, so your time is short. Describe the app that you need. A coding agent such as Claude Code or Codex builds it on the OpenAct core.</p>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>Deploy for free to your own Cloudflare account.</li>
        <li>Sign-in, roles and email are ready on day one.</li>
        <li>Run more than one company from one deploy.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rows viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="key rowk">Projects<span class="chip ok">included</span></div>
        <div class="key rowk">Client intake<span class="chip">built by your agent</span></div>
        <div class="key rowk">Invoices<span class="chip">built by your agent</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="card aud s6">
      <p class="eyebrow warm">Companies</p>
      <h3>Give each team agents with limits.</h3>
      <p>Your company has its own way of work. Build custom agentic apps for each team on one shared core. You keep control of what each agent can do.</p>
      <ul class="ticks warm">
        <li>An agent never does more than the person's role allows.</li>
        <li>Deletes and people changes wait for a person to approve them.</li>
        <li>One yearly price per company. No seats.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rows viz" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="key rowk">Sales · Pipeline<span class="chip">custom app</span></div>
        <div class="key rowk">Operations · Projects<span class="chip ok">included</span></div>
        <div class="key rowk">Support · Help desk<span class="chip">custom app</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
